      GlobalTheory.TripleRead.IsTransp ψ false Γ.M' om' ωB e (GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.UnitaryConjugation.conjU W₁ (-1) h.JW₁) (GlobalTheory.TripleRead.toUX X e h.JX) →
